<translate>
==== MinRange ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Used for weapons. Sets the minimum attack range of the weapon. Range affects the chance of hitting a target.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
MinRange = 0.61,
</syntaxhighlight>
